   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "On arrival",
   "texto": [
    "**En** + participle present forms the gerondif: **En arrivant, j'ai vu Thomas** (upon arrival, I saw Thomas).",
    "Relation to two actions of the same subject; depending on the context it can express simuleity, way or an immediately earlier action."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Same subject",
   "texto": [
    "In normal use, who does the action of the gerondif is also the subject of the main prayer: **En rentrant, je suis allé dormir** (when I returned, I went to sleep).",
    "It does not mean that both expressions name one action."
   ]
  },
